4b04e33eb68ce45c0bf75a17503e73676ffbc320feat(review): path owners and approvals that a change of some paths keeps (#353)

* feat(review): path owners and approvals that a change of some paths keeps

protect --owner <path>=<principal>,...: a merge whose change touches the path needs an
approval of the merged state by one of them; each owner group needs its own approval.
protect --keep-approvals <path>,...: an approval of an earlier version of the same change
counts for a newer version that changed only these paths after it. Both count approvals
as --approvals does, without the authors of the incoming states. A person owner approves
through a signed request.

